{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06308","headline":"归汝坟山庄留别卢象 · 祖咏","name":"归汝坟山庄留别卢象","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淹留岁将[晏]，久废南山期。\n旧业不见弃，还山从此辞。\n沤麻入南涧，刈麦向东菑。\n对酒鸡黍熟，闭门风雪时。\n非君一延首，谁慰遥相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}